# terminaltui internal compile cache (regenerated on first run)
**/.terminaltui/

# Demo build outputs (regenerated by `terminaltui build`)
demos/*/dist/
demos/*/node_modules/
demos/*/package-lock.json

# Note: demos/mac-monitor is also published standalone as `mac-monitor`, but its
# sources ship here too — the CLI's `terminaltui demo mac-monitor` runs them from
# the installed package. Only its build outputs above are excluded.

# iCloud Drive conflict copies (e.g. "index 2.js") re-materialize in dist/
* [0-9]
* [0-9].*
* [0-9] [0-9]*
